MODULE installer

FUNCTION resolve requested lock
    if refresh is false and a valid lock matches profile and platform, use it
    otherwise resolve a new lock from catalog and profile

FUNCTION install locked profile
    validate lock compatibility and prepare state directories
    for every package in dependency order
        skip a healthy package
        otherwise obtain its verified archive and install it transactionally
    write the exact lockfile only after every package succeeds

FUNCTION install one locked package
    create a fresh staging directory beside the final versioned store path
    extract with the configured expansion limit
    preserve an existing same-version target in local trash
    atomically rename staging to final target
    create and atomically publish a receipt
    on failure, preserve the failed state and restore the prior installation
    after success, preserve an older version referenced by the old receipt

FUNCTION remove package
    validate the package name
    move its store and receipt to recoverable local trash
    report both recovery locations
